  "name": "Jamaican Chili",
  "subtitle": "A hearty, warmly spiced beef and bean chili",
  "description": "Ground beef, peppers, tomatoes, and three kinds of beans simmer with aromatic spices, then finish with balsamic vinegar and cilantro.",
